triangles_incident\": 0, \"per_node\": {\"40\": 0, \"79\": 0, \"122\": 0, \"149\": 0, \"239\": 0, \"303\": 0, \"315\": 0, \"402\": 0, \"550\": 0, \"557\": 0, \"664\": 0, \"910\": 0}, \"window\": [29500, 34000]}", "latency_ms": 2, "tokens_before": 73667, "tokens_after": 73667, "ok": true, "error": ""}, {"rows_scanned": 16034, "step_id": "step_32", "tool": "triangle_count", "args": {"nodes": [40, 79, 122, 149, 239, 303, 315, 402, 550, 557, 664, 910], "window": [18400, 29500]}, "result_digest": "d878e40584036e76", "result_summary": "{\"n_triangles_incident\": 12, \"per_node\": {\"40\": 1, \"79\": 1, \"122\": 1, \"149\": 1, \"239\": 1, \"303\": 1, \"315\": 1, \"402\": 1, \"550\": 1, \"557\": 1, \"664\": 1, \"910\": 1}, \"window\": [18400, 29500]}", "latency_ms": 2, "tokens_before": 73667, "tokens_after": 73667, "ok": true, "error": ""}], "final_claim": {"task_id": "t_2434ac42", "decision": "absent", "mechanism": "compound", "entities": [40, 79, 122, 149, 239, 303, 315, 402, 550, 557, 664, 910, 882, 1931], "window": [18400, 36193], "confidence": 0.66, "evidence": [{"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_32", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_31", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_14", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_21", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_28", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_22", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_23", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_24", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_29", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_30", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_13", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_11", "role": "confounder_control"}], "narrative": "Both ingredients exist separately: the 12-node group completes all of its triangle closures inside [18400,29500] with no further closures afterwards, and a valid time-respecting route 882->63->816->291->1931 exists with gaps under 600. However the route's first hop occurs at t>=33501, which is more than 4000 time units after the closure wave finished (<=29500, and most likely ~24000-28000). The two phenomena are therefore temporally unlinked, so the compound mechanism is absent."}, "raw_final_response": "## Analysis\n\n**Part 1 \u2014 closure wave in the group.** All 12 group nodes sit on exactly one triangle each (step_03), and every one of those 12 triangles is already complete within [18400, 29500] (step_32), with *zero* new triangles forming in [29500, 34000] (step_31). The triangle-partner structure is visible per node (steps 04\u201310, 25\u201327: e.g. 40\u201379\u20131210, 149\u2013239\u2013550, 122\u2013664\u20131207, 303\u20131469\u20131748, 315\u20131581\u20131789, 402\u20131607\u20131708, 557\u20131093\u20131422, 910\u2013913\u2013918). Group activity is concentrated in [20001, 24000] (27 of ~62 events, step_14), tailing off to 3 events in [28001,30000]. So a closure wave exists and its last closing interaction occurs no later than **~29500**, most plausibly near 24000\u201328000.\n\n**Part 2 \u2014 temporal route 882 \u2192 1931.** A static path exists: 882\u219263\u2192816\u2192291\u21921931 (steps 11, 13). Timing it: 882\u219263 occurs in [32501,34500] (step_21) and node 63's only events there are at \u226533501 (step_28); 63\u2192816, 816\u2192291 and 291\u21921931 all occur in [34501,35000] (steps 22\u201324, 28\u201330). So a valid \u2264600-gap ordered route exists, but it **starts at t \u2265 33501**.\n\n**Coupling test.** Admissible start = wave end + 4000 \u2264 29500 + 4000 = 33500 (and realistically \u2248 28000\u201332000). The route's first hop at \u226533501 falls outside that admissible period \u2014 and the gap is larger still under the more likely wave-end estimate. The confounders (high overall volume, 3351 events / 1742 active nodes in step_01; a static connection existing in step_13; recent popularity of hub 817/816) do not rescue the coupling.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_2434ac42\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"compound\",\n  \"entities\": [40, 79, 122, 149, 239, 303, 315, 402, 550, 557, 664, 910, 882, 1931],\n  \"window\": [18400, 36193],\n  \"confidence\": 0.66,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_32\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_31\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_14\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_21\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_28\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_22\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_23\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_24\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_29\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_30\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"Both ingredients exist separately: the 12-node group completes all of its triangle closures inside [18400,29500] with no further closures afterwards, and a valid time-respecting route 882->63->816->291->1931 exists with gaps under 600. However the route's first hop occurs at t>=33501, which is more than 4000 time units after the closure wave finished (<=29500, and most likely ~24000-28000). The two phenomena are therefore temporally unlinked, so the compound mechanism is absent.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 87139, "total_output_tokens": 16631, "total_tokens": 103770, "total_latency_ms": 220075, "llm_calls": 11, "schema_repairs": 0, "tool_protocol_errors": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}